extends RefCounted
## Where the hero starts: from the street, from an ordinary family or as an
## oligarch's son. Each start has its own money, its own trouble and its own story.
##
## The trouble is a meter (0…100) that melts every day: health on the street,
## family ties at home, peace of mind in the golden cage. Paying for care brings
## it back. Below LOW rest is halved; at zero a crisis hits.
## Story beats show once, when their condition comes true:
##   "start" — at the very beginning, "day" — from that day, "rank" — from that
##   status, "venue" — the first business, "home" — the first own home,
##   "low" — the meter fell below the value. "calm" halves the melting from then on.

